   "text": "而他往左走。",
   "pause_before": 1
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "那條路的燈壞了一盞。",
   "pause_before": 1
  },
  {
   "t": "emphasis",
   "text": "而那一盞壞了三年。",
   "pause_before": 0
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而他每一次都往左。",
   "pause_before": 1
  },
  {
   "t": "narration",
   "text": "而他那一秒想起了一句話。",
   "pause_before": 2
  },
